# Keep this file narrow. Prefer fixing findings or documenting accepted risk
# with an issue link before adding ignore IDs here.

# AVD-DS-0002 (Image user should not be 'root'): accepted for our local
# dev/build images (app1/Dockerfile, app1/Dockerfile.bitnami). They bind-mount
# the host source tree and run `php artisan serve`/supervisor; a non-root USER
# breaks bind-mount permissions and the dev workflow. These images are not the
# production runtime. Revisit if these Dockerfiles are used to build prod.
AVD-DS-0002
